{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：11:02 2026-09-07 HKT</p>\n\n<p>將軍澳毓雅里10號仁濟醫院靚次伯紀念中學，今（7日）早上約9時，一名中四男生攀出學校建築物6樓樓梯位的石壆外，職員見狀報警求助。救援人員趕至，正進行游說。</p>\n<p>約5至6名談判專家接報趕至現場，與男生對話，據悉，男生疑受家庭問題困擾，表示「想見爸爸」。消防在場準備氣墊戒備。</p>\n<img alt=\"男生危站石壆外。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/75f28626e0b989b6d49564adf86b75cd/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-07_at_10_49_27.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8412d9e4865c6307c0c2d41355cf874b/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-07_at_10_49_28_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"男生危站石壆外。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0ebcb3abc2d4231019beae957576279e/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-07_at_10_49_27_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/62bc5b47a20dd4648c3098009aa23270/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-07_at_10_49_28.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9cf6e2e7c4beda2fd2c343be8381efd5/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-07_at_10_49_27_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-07T03:20:19.848435+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":160,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}